Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FFmpeg
    voice_runtime/tools/ffmpeg-7.1-lgpl-shared/

    An unmodified prebuilt FFmpeg 7.1 LGPL shared build is vendored for the
    optional local voice runtime. FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU Lesser
    General Public License, version 3. Its full license text is included at
    voice_runtime/tools/ffmpeg-7.1-lgpl-shared/
        ffmpeg-n7.1-latest-win64-lgpl-shared-7.1/LICENSE.txt

    Grandpa invokes FFmpeg as a separate executable via subprocess. It does
    not link against libavcodec, libavformat, or any other FFmpeg library,
    and no FFmpeg source has been modified.

    Corresponding source and build provenance for this binary distribution
    are recorded in voice_runtime/README.md.
